ke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://zenithtools.itch.io/war-room/devlog\"><svg role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4781320/war-room\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">War Room</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_763962\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_2766931\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"360\" data-width=\"640\" class=\"game_frame start_maximized game_pending\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18563648/index.html?v=1785146418&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" aria-hidden><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><div style=\"text-align:center; padding:32px 0 20px; margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <h1 style=\"font-size:38px; margin:0 0 6px; color:#d4a574\">War Room</h1>\r\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px; color:#9a9088; margin:0\">\r\n    A 100% client-side narrative strategy game. Like Risk, but every plan you write is judged by an AI Game Master who decides whether your strategy earns victory or catastrophe.\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NTExNjcxLnBuZw==/original/jlwR%2Bi.png\" alt=\"War Room home screen showing the main menu with New Game, Import Match, Tutorial, and Buy me a coffee options in English\" style=\"width:100%; border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4)\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:22px; margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <p style=\"color:#e8e3d8; margin:0; font-size:15px\">\r\n    Every turn you write a <strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">free-text plan</strong> in plain language: &quot;I send the Black Legion through the Alpine passes at night, bribing the border guards with plundered Milanese gold.&quot; An AI <strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">Game Master</strong> reads it, weighs your perks against the defender&#x27;s, factors in the scenario and epoch, and adjudicates. Sometimes you conquer. Sometimes your legion vanishes in a blizzard. The map changes. The chronicle writes itself.\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">How it works</h2>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:18px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 6px; font-size:13px\">1. Configure</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0; font-size:13px\">\r\n      Bring your own API key (OpenAI, Gemini, or OpenRouter: free tier works). Pick a map, a victory condition, and a world scenario.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:18px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 6px; font-size:13px\">2. Plan</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0; font-size:13px\">\r\n      On your turn, describe your action in natural language. No menus, no click-attack-click-end-turn, just prose. Creativity is rewarded.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:18px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 6px; font-size:13px\">3. Adjudicate</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0; font-size:13px\">\r\n      The Game Master writes a 3 to 6 sentence narrative ruling: success, failure, or partial outcome. It may also trigger side effects that reshape any faction on the board.\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">Features</h2>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Three Maps</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">Italy (22 territories), USA (50 states), Europe (43 nations). Real borders, real adjacency, including maritime shortcuts.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Two AI Engines</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">A neutral Game Master judges every action. An Opponent AI runs the enemy factions with their own personality and strategy.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Five Scenarios</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">Mixed, Hyper Realism (with epoch: try 1350), Fantasy, Sci-Fi, or your own custom ruleset. The scenario shapes every ruling.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Advisor and Appeal</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">Think the GM was unfair? Call the Advisor: an independent AI that reviews the whole turn and can overturn the verdict.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">100% Client-Side</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">No backend, no database, no tracking. Your API key never leaves your browser. Saves live in your localStorage.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Hotseat Multiplayer</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">Any faction can be controlled by a human or the AI. Play solo against AI, or pass the device around and each take a faction.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:16px\">\r\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:13px\">Bilingual UI</h3>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">Full UI and AI narration in English or Italian. Switch language at any time.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">Screenshots</h2>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <div style=\"min-width:0\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NTExNzgwLnBuZw==/original/CusHTg.png\" alt=\"War Room main game board with map and faction sidebar\" style=\"width:100%; border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4)\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"min-width:0\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NTExODAwLnBuZw==/original/gR%2FM%2BY.png\" alt=\"War Room Game Master narrative ruling with side effects\" style=\"width:100%; border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4)\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"min-width:0\">\r\n    <img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NTExODAyLnBuZw==/original/Nzrc%2Bw.png\" alt=\"War Room setup wizard with scenario selection and faction editor\" style=\"width:100%; border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4)\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">Choose your world</h2>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:20px; margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <table style=\"width:100%\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n      <tr style=\"\">\r\n        <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px 6px; color:#d4a574; font-size:12px\">Scenario</th>\r\n        <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px 6px; color:#d4a574; font-size:12px\">Vibe</th>\r\n        <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px 6px; color:#d4a574; font-size:12px\">Epoch</th>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n      <tr style=\"\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#e8e3d8\"><strong>Mixed</strong></td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Realism, absurdity, magic coexist. Default. Anything goes.</td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">No</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n      <tr style=\"\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#e8e3d8\"><strong>Hyper Realism</strong></td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Strict physics, geopolitics, logistics. Judge as a real strategist would.</td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Yes. Pick any year, the GM uses real history.</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n      <tr style=\"\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#e8e3d8\"><strong>Fantasy</strong></td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Spells, dragons, mythological creatures. Internal consistency still matters.</td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">No</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n      <tr style=\"\">\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#e8e3d8\"><strong>Sci-Fi</strong></td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Cyberwar, orbital strikes, AI swarms, genetic engineering.</td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">No</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#e8e3d8\"><strong>Custom</strong></td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">Write your own ruleset in plain text. The GM follows it.</td>\r\n        <td style=\"padding:10px 6px; color:#9a9088\">No</td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">Technical</h2>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:20px; margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px; color:#e8e3d8; font-size:14px\">\r\n    <li><strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">Runs in browser.</strong> No install, no download. Plays on desktop and modern tablets.</li>\r\n    <li><strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">Bring your own key.</strong> OpenAI, Google Gemini, or OpenRouter (free tier works fine).</li>\r\n    <li><strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">No backend.</strong> Your API key, your plans, and your save files stay on your device.</li>\r\n    <li><strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">Bilingual UI.</strong> Switch between English and Italian at any time.</li>\r\n    <li><strong style=\"color:#d4a574\">Save and resume.</strong> Matches persist in localStorage. Export and import as JSON.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:20px; margin:32px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px\">FAQ</h2>\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(120,90,50,0.4); padding:20px; margin-bottom:28px\">\r\n  <p style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:14px\">Do I need to pay to play?</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0 0 14px\">The game is free. You need an LLM API key. OpenRouter has free models that work out of the box. Paid models (GPT-4, Claude, etc.) give richer narration but aren&#x27;t required.</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:14px\">Where does my API key go?</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0 0 14px\">Nowhere. It&#x27;s stored in your browser&#x27;s localStorage and sent directly from your browser to your chosen provider. No server in the middle.</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:14px\">Single-player or multiplayer?</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0 0 14px\">Both. Any faction can be set to Human or AI in the setup wizard. Play solo against AI opponents, or gather friends around one device in hotseat mode and each take command of a faction. The AI plays any faction you don&#x27;t claim, with its own personality and strategy.</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#d4a574; margin:0 0 4px; font-size:14px\">Can the AI cheat?</p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0\">The Game Master is instructed to be a fair, impartial arbiter: no deus ex machina, symmetric realism, narrative weight. If you disagree with a ruling, the Advisor system lets you appeal and an independent AI re-reviews the turn.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; border:1px solid rgba(212,165,116,0.4); padding:28px 20px; margin:32px 0 20px\">\r\n  <h2 style=\"color:#d4a574; font-size:22px; margin:0 0 8px\">Take command</h2>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#e8e3d8; font-size:14px; margin:0 0 18px\">Play in your browser. No download, no signup. Bring a free OpenRouter key and you&#x27;re ready in 60 seconds.</p>\r\n  <a href=\"https://war-room-game.vercel.app/\" style=\"background:#d4a574; color:#1a1a1f; padding:12px 28px; font-size:15px\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Play now</a>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:center; padding:20px 0 8px; margin-top:24px\">\r\n  <p style=\"color:#9a9088; margin:0 0 6px\">\r\n    <a href=\"https://war-room-game.vercel.app/\" style=\"color:#d4a574\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Play the web version</a>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#5a544c; font-size:11px; margin:0\">No tracking. No backend. Your move, Commander.</p>\r\n</div></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg aria-hidden width=\"12\" height=\"6\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_3451173\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 3 total ratings\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=\"5.0\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div class=\"star_fill\" style=\"width: 100.00000%\"><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><div class=\"star_holes\"><span class=\"star icon-star2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div></div><span content=\"3\" itemprop=\"ratingCount\" class=\"rating_count\">(3<span class=\"screenreader_only\"> total ratings</span>)</span></div></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://zenithtools.itch.io\">ZenithTools</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-strategy\">Strategy</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation\">Simulation</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-alternate-history\">Alternate History</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-artificial-intelligence\">artificial-intelligence</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-board-game\">Board Game</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-sandbox\">Sandbox</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-text-based\">Text based</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-turn-based\">Turn-based</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-turn-based-strategy\">Turn-based Strategy</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-war\">War</a></td></tr><tr><td>Average session</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/duration-hours\">A few hours</a></td></tr><tr><td>Languages</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-de\">German</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-en\">English</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-es-419\">Spanish; Latin America</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-fr\">French</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-it\">Italian</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-ja\">Japanese</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-ko\">Korean</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-pt\">Portuguese (Portugal)</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-ru\">Russian</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-zh_Hans\">Chinese (Simplified)</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/lang-zh_Hant\">Chinese (Traditional)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Inputs</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/input-keyboard\">Keyboard</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/input-mouse\">Mouse</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/input-touchscreen\">Touchscreen</a></td></tr><tr><td>Accessibility</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/accessibility-subtitles\">Subtitles</a></td></tr><tr><td>Multiplayer</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/local-multiplayer\">Local multiplayer</a></td></tr><tr><td>Player count</td><td>1 - 4</td></tr><tr><td>Links</td><td><a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ZenithToolsDev\">YouTube</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://discord.gg/EaqgHvr2nu\">Discord</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@zenithtools.dev\">TikTok</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/zenithtoolsdev/\">Instagram</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://x.com/ZenithToolsDev\">Twitter/X</a></td></tr><tr><td>AI Disclosure</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/ai-assisted\">AI Assisted</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/ai-text\">Text</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><section id=\"devlog\" class=\"game_devlog\"><h2>Development log</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://zenithtools.itch.io/war-room/devlog/1604627/war-room-v13-dynamic-audio-integration-mobile-compatibility\">War Room v1.3: Dynamic Audio Integration + Mobile Compatibility!</a><div class=\"post_date\"><abbr title=\"26 July 2026 @ 14:01 UTC\"><span class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 38 days ago</abbr></div></li><li><a href=\"https://zenithtools.itch.io/war-room/devlog/1600186/war-room-v12-11-languages-supported-hardened-ai-gm-security\">War Room v1.2: 11 Languages Supported + Hardened AI GM Security!</a><div class=\"post_date\"><abbr title=\"23 July 2026 @ 14:07 UTC\"><span class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 41 days ago</abbr></div></li></ul></section><div id=\"game_comments_8404386\" class=\"game_comments_widget base_widget\"><h2 id=\"comments\">Comments</h2><p class=\"form_placeholder\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fzenithtools.itch.io%2Fwar-room\" data-register_action=\"comment\">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p><div id=\"community_topic_posts_3918973\" class=\"community_topic_posts_widget base_widget\"><div id=\"community_post_list_6580734\" class=\"community_post_list_widget base_widget\"><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column\" id=\"post-16644700\" data-p